    comon:definedInArtifact comon:PolicyArtifact_POLICIES_REV_01 ;
    comon:hasPolicyStatement "Every state must be modeled as a first-class temporal entity. It must record `validFrom` upon creation and `validTo` only when it ends. A state derived from an observation must retain an explicit link to its source evidence. Planned expiration must not reuse `validTo` before effective closure." ;
